    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy are delighted to present New to the market, a Residential Holding ?? c. 26 Acres (10.51 Hectares). Considered an excellent opportunity to acquire a versatile residential holding situated in a peaceful, highly scenic rural setting located in the townland of Keyfield, within easy reach of Ballinlough Village and the commercial towns of Ballyhaunis and Castlerea. Extending to approximately 26 acres (10.51 hectares) in total, the property features a detached residence which should qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and SEAI energy upgrade schemes, offering an ideal renovation project for owner-occupiers or investors. The holding is being offered to the market with ultimate flexibility, available either in its entirety or open to individual offers across six distinct lots. Buyers can bid on individual parcels tailored to their specific needs, including Lot 7 (c. 4.49 acres / 1.82 Ha including house), Lot 7A (c. 1.08 acres / 0.44 Ha) providing excellent frontage and privacy, and Lot 7B C (c. 1.70 acres / 0.69 Ha) offering a highly accessible strip of ground adjacent to the residence. For those seeking independent agricultural or investment parcels, offers are also invited for Lot 7D (c. 0.32 acres / 0.13 Ha) which forms a compact road-side plot, Lot 7E (c. 6.20 acres / 2.51 Ha) a generously sized parcel nested beside mature forestry, and Lot 10 (c. 12.70 acres / 5.15 Ha) which represents a substantial standalone agricultural block with independent lane access. This layout makes the property uniquely suited to progressive local farmers looking to extend their existing acreage, forestry investors, or lifestyle buyers seeking a country home with a manageable parcel of ground. Immediate Enquiries Invited. \n\nOutside\nREFER TO MAP Lot 7: c. 4.49 Acres (1.82 Hectares) ?? House and adjoining field Lot 7A: c. 1.08 Acres (0.44 Hectares) 7B C: c. 1.70 Acres (0.69 Hectares) 7D: c. 0.32 Acres (0.13 Hectares) Lot 7E: c. 6.20 Acres (2.51 Hectares) ?? Lot 10: c. 12.70 Acres (5.15 Hectares) The Entire Holding: c. 26 Acres (10.51 Hectares)"
      },
